// stdlib/hetero/silicon/nvidia/amp86.sio
//
// sm_86 cubins from ptxas 12.8.61. The IMAD.MOV immediate word matches
// sm_80 and sm_89. The DMUL word matches sm_70, sm_80 and sm_89.
// These images are Ampere ELF (flags 0x460556). The L4 is sm_89 and
// accepts an 8.6 cubin. The A5000 was not free.

